from pathlib import Path
import json
ROOT=Path(__file__).resolve().parents[2];out=ROOT/'out/rmuc2027-installed-reference-review';s=json.loads((out/'review.json').read_text())
notes={
'core-head':'Collision priority: inspect the dense internal hardware and layered sheet faces separately from the outer head. Keep the real slots, central opening and attachment interfaces. The protected visual head stays unchanged.',
'core-arm':'Candidate for both roles: rebuild long tubes and joint housings from measured sections. For collision, remove small collar grooves and screw recesses; retain joint centers, reach and outer clearance. Inspect the existing faceted caps before choosing segment counts.',
'dart-deck':'Collision priority: the selected perforated plate costs 1,616 triangles per occurrence (two occurrences). Reconstruct its outer plate and selectively close small fastener holes; preserve thickness, edge cutouts and required openings. Other repeated rollers and brackets need separate inspection. The selected dense member differs between visual and collision files; these are inspection views, not an aligned surface comparison. Preserve exposed rail/support faces and moving-door clearance.',
'dart-frame':'Candidate for both roles: a single large member per station dominates this scope. Rebuild its broad sheets and section returns, retaining thickness and the large open frame. Do not wrap the whole station in a box.'}
for k,t in s['targets'].items():t['note']=notes[k]
s={'targets':{k:{'label':t['label'],'note':t['note'],'visual':{'placed_triangles':t['visual']['placed_triangles']},'collision':{'placed_triangles':t['collision']['placed_triangles']}}for k,t in s['targets'].items()},'views':s['views']}
html='''<!doctype html><html><head><style>body{font:14px var(--font-sans);color:var(--foreground)}select,button{font:inherit;padding:8px;background:var(--secondary);color:inherit;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px}nav{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:12px 0}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px}img{width:100%;display:block}small{color:var(--muted-foreground)}p{line-height:1.5}.count{font-weight:600;margin:6px 0}@media(max-width:500px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style></head><body><p><b>Installed reference · first dense-part inspection</b><br>355,542 visual / 545,599 collision triangles. Exact frozen copies; no simplification applied.</p><nav><select id="target"></select><select id="view"><option value="oblique">Oblique</option><option value="reverse">Reverse</option></select><select id="context"><option value="isolated_path">Isolated selected part</option><option value="path">Installed map context</option></select></nav><div class="grid"><div><b>Installed visual</b><div id="vc" class="count"></div><img id="vi"></div><div><b>Installed collision</b><div id="cc" class="count"></div><img id="ci"></div></div><p id="note"></p><small>Counts cover the complete component scope and all placements. Dart images isolate its densest member; Core images show the complete selected scope at one placement. Collision materials are imported proxy colors. Orthographic flat shading, not simulator lighting.</small><script>const data=DATA;const target=document.querySelector('#target');for(const[k,t]of Object.entries(data.targets)){const o=document.createElement('option');o.value=k;o.textContent=t.label;target.append(o)}function update(){const k=target.value,t=data.targets[k];for(const[r,p]of [['visual','v'],['collision','c']]){const v=data.views.find(x=>x.target===k&&x.role===r&&x.view===document.querySelector('#view').value);document.querySelector('#'+p+'i').src=v[document.querySelector('#context').value];document.querySelector('#'+p+'c').textContent=t[r].placed_triangles.toLocaleString()+' triangles across map';}document.querySelector('#note').textContent=t.note;}document.querySelectorAll('select').forEach(x=>x.onchange=update);update();</script></body></html>'''.replace('DATA',json.dumps(s))
(out/'gallery.html').write_text(html)
